                      (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00073 ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
                      (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00074 RESTORE_BG:
7D43 C630             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00075         LDB     #48
                      (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00076 REST_ROW:
7D45 3404             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00077         PSHS    B
7D47 EC81             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00078         LDD     ,X++
7D49 EDC1             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00079         STD     ,U++
7D4B EC81             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00080         LDD     ,X++
7D4D EDC1             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00081         STD     ,U++
7D4F EC81             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00082         LDD     ,X++
7D51 EDC1             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00083         STD     ,U++
7D53 EC81             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00084         LDD     ,X++
7D55 EDC1             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00085         STD     ,U++
7D57 EC81             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00086         LDD     ,X++
7D59 EDC1             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00087         STD     ,U++
7D5B EC81             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00088         LDD     ,X++
7D5D EDC1             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00089         STD     ,U++
7D5F 33C814           (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00090         LEAU    20,U                    ; Next scanline (32 - 12 = 20)
7D62 3504             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00091         PULS    B
7D64 5A               (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00092         DECB
