7E2E A480             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00214         ANDA    ,X+
7E30 E480             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00215         ANDB    ,X+
7E32 AAA0             (C:\Dev\github\philippeback\coco\):00216         ORA     ,Y+
